# Jovie — Cursor Agent Rules (thin pointer)

**Canonical instructions live in [`AGENTS.md`](../../AGENTS.md) (→ `CLAUDE.md`).**
Read it, then the scoped rule for your topic in `.claude/rules/*`.

Corrections to guidance that previously lived in this file (it was severely stale
and caused failing PRs):

- **Branch model:** small PRs target `main` via the native GitHub merge queue.
  There is NO `develop` or `preview` branch. Never push to `main` directly.
  See `docs/PR_FLOW.md` and `.github/MERGE_QUEUE.md`.
- **Stack:** Next.js 15 + Neon PostgreSQL with Drizzle ORM. The app was
  MIGRATED OFF Supabase — do not write Supabase client code, RLS policies, or
  `auth.jwt()` SQL. See `.claude/rules/db.md`.
- **Required checks:** PR Ready, Migration Guard, Fork PR Gate, PR Size Guard
  (`.github/BRANCH_PROTECTION.md`). Report exact check failures — never ignore them.
- **Design system:** `DESIGN.md` (Noir Ion) + `.claude/rules/ui.md`. Inter is the
  sole body font; Satoshi display-only.
